'''High School Kingpin Riki''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by purchasing the 11-draw Capsule at the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during [[River City Ransom Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 12.7 Update|Version 12.7]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 721
|rarity = UR
|name1 = High School Kingpin Riki
|name2 = Dodgeball Riki
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Dodgeball Riki''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
This unit, much like [[Kunio-kun (Uber Rare Cat)|Kunio-kun]], is primarily used for his combo, which boosts your units' health a lot for the single slot it takes, and other efficient combos can be used alongside it with an even greater effect. Stat-wise, it isn't really that useful, and is only a serviceable backliner or tanker in early game.

{{Job|Classification = Tanker & Melee & Combo Slave|EvolvedClass = Sniper & Crowd-Controller & Combo Slave|TrueClass=|UltraClass=}}

